":[{"type":"text","text":"Manual Slide Break Macro","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Authors can insert a "},{"type":"text","text":"<slideBreak>","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" macro anywhere in the document to force a break."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The viewer then renders only the chunk of AST nodes that fall between the active slide's delimiters, providing a clean, focused presentation without altering the underlying document state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Source: design/02_editor_core.md"}]}]}

